WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.242
"Mom, can Jim come over?" asked Harry.

2
00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:13.199
Mom looked in Harry's room.

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.783
His clothes were all over the floor.

4
00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:23.435
Toys and books were everywhere.

5
00:00:23.436 --> 00:00:26.545
"Yes," said Mom.

6
00:00:26.546 --> 00:00:31.902
"But first you must clean your room."

7
00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:35.792
Harry put his books on the bookshelf.

8
00:00:35.793 --> 00:00:39.858
He put his toy robots in a basket.

9
00:00:39.859 --> 00:00:44.668
And he hung his clothes in the closet.

10
00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:50.847
Soon Harry's room was very neat.

11
00:00:50.848 --> 00:00:54.496
Jim rang the doorbell.

12
00:00:54.497 --> 00:00:57.429
Harry opened the door for him.

13
00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.834
"Hey, Harry!" said Jim.

14
00:00:59.835 --> 00:01:03.759
"Hi, Jim," said Harry.

15
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.368
"Come on in!"

16
00:01:06.369 --> 00:01:12.287
They went upstairs to Harry's room.

17
00:01:12.288 --> 00:01:15.329
Jim looked at Harry's books.

18
00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:19.603
He pulled a few of them off the shelf.

19
00:01:19.604 --> 00:01:27.056
Jim dropped the books on the floor.

20
00:01:27.057 --> 00:01:33.440
Next he picked up a model car.

21
00:01:33.441 --> 00:01:39.358
"This car is cool," said Jim.

22
00:01:39.359 --> 00:01:42.212
Jim poked the car's wheel.

23
00:01:42.213 --> 00:01:46.020
The wheel popped off.

24
00:01:46.021 --> 00:01:50.433
"Oops, sorry about that," said Jim.

25
00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:55.236
Harry sighed.

26
00:01:55.237 --> 00:02:02.372
"It's not a big deal," he said.

27
00:02:02.373 --> 00:02:06.657
Jim looked through the basket.

28
00:02:06.658 --> 00:02:11.119
He dumped toy robots on the floor.

29
00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:14.782
Soon Harry's room was a mess.

30
00:02:14.783 --> 00:02:19.675
Finally Jim went home.

31
00:02:19.676 --> 00:02:23.654
Harry looked at the mess in his room.

32
00:02:23.655 --> 00:02:26.652
"Ugh," he said.

33
00:02:26.653 --> 00:02:37.832
He started picking up his things.

34
00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:40.994
"What are you doing?" asked Mom.

35
00:02:40.995 --> 00:02:43.860
Harry sighed.

36
00:02:43.861 --> 00:02:53.179
"I'm cleaning my room—again!" he said.

